would run: git commit -m 'briefs: architect-task report' -m <Attribution> -- T/cost.txt docs/tokenspeed.md
would run: git checkout -- crates/rs2nika/convert/nikaia.lock
would run: append T/architect-task.md to T/unpushed.txt (tested with the next batch)
